# shelf — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values. NEVER commit .env.
# Only Tier A (the Cloudflare R2 default) + Tier E (upload-state store) + the
# inherited Anthropic/E2B/GitHub keys are wired today. Tier B (S3) and Tier D
# (self-host image transforms) are documented in brain/TOOL-MATRIX.md §9 and
# added only when a workload chooses that path (alts documented-not-wired).
#
# THE ACCEPTANCE MERGE GATE NEEDS NONE OF THESE: Form 1 runs against a local
# MinIO container with throwaway minioadmin/minioadmin creds (D15). These keys
# only light up Form 2 (live R2 in an E2B sandbox / the Sandbox component) and
# the real lifecycle-audit + RSI cron sweeps.

# ── Tier A — Cloudflare R2 (the DEFAULT backend; O-05) ──────────────────────
# Free tier: 10 GB storage, ZERO egress. shelf's own presign_upload uses the
# AWS-SDK-v3 presigner (region:"auto" + R2_ENDPOINT), so the bar never depends
# on the R2 MCP minting URLs (V-12 unconfirmed).
# Get at: Cloudflare dash → R2 → Manage R2 API Tokens → create (S3 auth).
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=shelf-accept
# Derive from the account id: https://<R2_ACCOUNT_ID>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com
R2_ENDPOINT=
# Least-privilege token (R2 + Images) for the CONSUMED cloudflare MCP lens (O-23).
# Get at: Cloudflare dash → API Tokens → Create (R2 read/write only).
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=

# ── Local CI target — MinIO (the $0/tokenless merge gate; D15) ──────────────
# The acceptance Form-1 gate points the shelf CLI at a local MinIO via these
# S3_* vars. In CI MinIO is started with throwaway minioadmin/minioadmin —
# NEVER a real secret. Locally: docker run -p 9000:9000 -e MINIO_ROOT_USER=minioadmin \
#   -e MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=minioadmin bitnamilegacy/minio:2025.7.23-debian-12-r5
S3_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000
S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=minioadmin
S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin

# ── Tier E — upload-state store (NEVER new Map() on serverless; O-25/P-40) ───
# Use Upstash Redis (free tier) OR reuse the present Supabase. No shelf command
# requires state today, so either path is optional until one is needed.
# Get at: https://console.upstash.com → create database (free tier).
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# Alternative state store (reuse instead of provisioning Upstash):
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ── Inherited (ported from energy/.env; present, never printed) ──────────────
# Claude API (Messages API + Agent SDK). Get at: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# E2B Firecracker microVM sandboxes (the Form-2 live-R2 round-trip). Get at: https://e2b.dev/dashboard
E2B_API_KEY=e2b_...
# GitHub PAT (Actions push + the github MCP). Get at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=ghp_...

# ── RSI Claude-half (DEFERRED — D8) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The deterministic $0 drift-watch loop runs without this. The Claude half
# (writes corrected brain prose / proposes new golden tasks) lights up only
# when this is set. See CHAIRMAN-CHECKLIST.md for the exact gh secret command.
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# ── Tier B (S3 path — documented, wire only if a workload needs it) ──────────
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AWS_REGION=
# S3_BUCKET=
# (+ a CloudFront signing key-pair for private-asset signed URLs)

# ── Tier D (self-host image transforms — IMGPROXY_KEY/SALT mandatory in prod, O-12) ──
# IMGPROXY_KEY=
# IMGPROXY_SALT=
# IMGPROXY_ALLOWED_SOURCES=
